      "negMarks": 0,
      "questionText": "Integer p, q, r Set p = 4, q = 2, r = 5 p = (q + p) + p if ((q + p) < (r - q) && 3 > p) then p = (q + r) + p if (((p + r) + (r + q)) <= (p + r + q)) then r = q + p else r = (p + r) + p end if p = (9 & 6) + q else q = r & r if ((q - 5) < (5 - q)) then r = (6 + 6) & q q = (q + 7) + r end if p = (1 ^ 11) + q end if Print p + q + r",
      "questionHtml": "<p>Integer p, q, r&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Set p = 4, q = 2, r = 5&nbsp;</p>\n<p>p = (q + p) + p&nbsp;</p>\n<p>if ((q + p) &lt; (r - q) &amp;&amp; 3 &gt; p) then&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp;p = (q + r) + p&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp;if (((p + r) + (r + q)) &lt;= (p + r + q)) then&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; r = q + p&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp;else&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; r = (p + r) + p&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp;end if&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp;p = (9 &amp; 6) + q&nbsp;</p>\n<p>else&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp;q = r &amp; r&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp;if ((q - 5) &lt; (5 - q)) then&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; r = (6 + 6) &amp; q&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; q = (q + 7) + r&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp;end if&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp;p = (1 ^ 11) + q&nbsp;</p>\n<p>end if&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Print p + q + r</p>\n<p></p>",
